# The area the Europe routing graph covers: the cut of each Geofabrik extract
# it is built from (infra/routing/europe-extracts.txt, in its order), as
# Geofabrik publishes it at https://download.geofabrik.de/<path>.poly
# (Osmosis polygon format, longitude then latitude), read on 2026-10-07.
# Geofabrik draws these cuts from OpenStreetMap's boundaries (ODbL,
# "© OpenStreetMap contributors", "Geofabrik GmbH"). Each one follows a line
# "extract <path>". An extract added to the list adds its cut here, in the
# same change: lunaway_domain::routing::coverage reads this file and its
# tests compare the two lists.
extract europe/france
